WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.806 --> 00:00:03.372
- [Ray] Yeah, I don't think
there's no better life

00:00:03.372 --> 00:00:05.463
than a fisherman's life.

00:00:05.463 --> 00:00:07.480
(lighthearted country guitar music)

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:09.881
- [Warren] Ain't nothin' like
getting up before daylight,

00:00:09.881 --> 00:00:11.126
getting out on the water and see

00:00:11.126 --> 00:00:13.919
that sun come up over the horizon.

00:00:13.919 --> 00:00:14.890
- We gonna get to pull in catfish pots

00:00:14.890 --> 00:00:16.034
in the mornin', ain't we?

00:00:16.034 --> 00:00:17.151
- Yeah.

00:00:17.151 --> 00:00:19.061
- We always together when
we go out in that water

00:00:19.061 --> 00:00:20.990
most of the time.

00:00:20.990 --> 00:00:22.586
- [Ray] Everybody said they
don't know how two brothers

00:00:22.586 --> 00:00:24.853
could work together as
many years as we have

00:00:24.853 --> 00:00:27.613
and still be working together.

00:00:27.613 --> 00:00:29.113
You give and take.

00:00:34.578 --> 00:00:37.378
Some Sundays we don't see each other

00:00:37.378 --> 00:00:39.961
but other than that, every day.

00:00:44.478 --> 00:00:48.447
- Ray and I does our own
thing early every mornin'.

00:00:48.447 --> 00:00:53.438
We finish up (mumbles)
and we meet at the shop.

00:00:53.438 --> 00:00:56.655
I love to see him every
mornin' over there.

00:00:56.655 --> 00:00:58.405
It makes a great day.

00:01:01.321 --> 00:01:04.137
It's gonna happen one day.

00:01:04.137 --> 00:01:04.970
- [Ray] There's gonna be one morning

00:01:04.970 --> 00:01:05.803
when we're not together.

00:01:05.803 --> 00:01:07.313
- Yep.

00:01:07.313 --> 00:01:10.887
If I go first, I'll see him later.

00:01:10.887 --> 00:01:13.220
- He's gonna save me a seat.

00:01:14.742 --> 00:01:16.267
And if I go first, I'm gonna save him one

00:01:16.267 --> 00:01:18.100
right alongside of me.

00:01:19.760 --> 00:01:21.671
- We might be fishing up there.

00:01:21.671 --> 00:01:22.917
- Yeah, the Lord might give us a boat.

00:01:22.917 --> 00:01:25.167
- We'll take Jesus fishin'.

00:01:27.736 --> 00:01:29.736
Catch lots of fish then.

00:01:31.433 --> 00:01:33.798
- [Ray] That's the real plus
to life to know that you got

00:01:33.798 --> 00:01:37.379
somebody that is on the
same frequency you are

00:01:37.379 --> 00:01:40.712
and someone you confide in and know that

00:01:42.412 --> 00:01:43.520
if I need a hand over here all I gotta do

00:01:43.520 --> 00:01:47.358
is call him and he'll come
and the same with him to me.

00:01:47.358 --> 00:01:48.571
If I didn't have a brother like him,

00:01:48.571 --> 00:01:50.439
I don't know what I'd do.

00:01:50.439 --> 00:01:51.272
- Ditto.

